{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/ks1b234bbbs222233222222222b.gif?t=1746983558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soar through the skies on the back of a dragon and explore a beautifully rendered Metroidvania world that combines both land and aerial combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/ks1b234bbbs222233222222222bb.gif?t=1746983558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">encounter new gear to customize your play style and craft Iria's look to your vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/ks1b234bbbs222233222222222bbb.gif?t=1746983558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ghost Hand is a Soviet inspired fantasy Metroidvania. Immerse yourself in a vast, atmospheric fantasy world, brimming with secrets to uncover and a story that would make any JRPG proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features an art style that blends seamlessly the oil paint pixel art aesthetics of Owlboy in a 2.5D environment similar to Klonoa, in a world with Exploration and Character customization inspired by the likes of Symphony of the Night with Ori inspired Bosses, while having the capability of mounting a Dragon and toasting your enemies like you would Drakengard.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2563880?t=1746983558","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/ab36366c0952dc4915d46ec005382397b3e88b44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746983558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/281abd9dee5c3e02aaa5b0b835e07211da43ef57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746983558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/281abd9dee5c3e02aaa5b0b835e07211da43ef57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746983558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/ks1b234bbbs222233222222222b.gif?t=1746983558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soar through the skies on the back of a dragon and explore a beautifully rendered Metroidvania world that combines both land and aerial combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/ks1b234bbbs222233222222222bb.gif?t=1746983558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">encounter new gear to customize your play style and craft Iria's look to your vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/ks1b234bbbs222233222222222bbb.gif?t=1746983558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ghost Hand is a Soviet inspired fantasy Metroidvania. Immerse yourself in a vast, atmospheric fantasy world, brimming with secrets to uncover and a story that would make any JRPG proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features an art style that blends seamlessly the oil paint pixel art aesthetics of Owlboy in a 2.5D environment similar to Klonoa, in a world with Exploration and Character customization inspired by the likes of Symphony of the Night with Ori inspired Bosses, while having the capability of mounting a Dragon and toasting your enemies like you would Drakengard.</p>","dev